sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FE as Klien
    participant FN as Netlify Function
    participant C as DbClient (supabaseJson)
    participant T as Targets
    participant CORE as Neon CORE
    participant CMP as Neon COMPUTE
    participant HK as HttpKernel

    Note over FE,CMP: Alur 1 — satu request menyentuh dua project

    FE->>FN: POST getAppData
    FN->>C: GET sys_config
    C->>T: targetOf('sys_config')
    T-->>C: 'core'
    C->>HK: request(urlCORE, dep='postgrest')
    HK->>CORE: GET /rest/v1/sys_config
    CORE-->>HK: 200 rows
    HK-->>C: Response
    C-->>FN: rows

    FN->>C: POST job_queue (enqueue)
    C->>T: targetOf('job_queue')
    T-->>C: 'compute'
    C->>HK: request(urlCOMPUTE, dep='postgrest:compute')
    HK->>CMP: POST /rest/v1/job_queue
    CMP-->>HK: 201
    HK-->>C: Response
    C-->>FN: ok
    FN-->>FE: 200

    Note over HK,CMP: Breaker/bulkhead TERPISAH per label.
    Note over HK,CMP: postgrest:compute terbuka TIDAK menolak postgrest (CORE).

    Note over FE,CMP: Alur 2 — COMPUTE suspend, CORE tetap hidup

    CMP--xHK: 5xx SQLSTATE 53000 (compute suspended)
    HK->>HK: breaker.failure('postgrest:compute') x5
    HK->>HK: breaker OPEN untuk 'postgrest:compute' saja
    FE->>FN: POST loginKandidat
    FN->>C: GET session_revocations
    C->>T: targetOf('session_revocations')
    T-->>C: 'core'
    C->>HK: request(urlCORE, dep='postgrest')
    HK->>CORE: GET /rest/v1/session_revocations
    CORE-->>HK: 200 rows
    HK-->>FN: rows
    FN-->>FE: 200 (login tetap jalan)

    Note over FE,CMP: Alur 3 — rotasi COMPUTE tanpa pg_dump

    Note over CMP: project #2 suspend / dibuang
    Note over CMP: project #3 dibuat
    Note over CMP: role asj_service dibuat manual
    Note over CMP: Data API + JWKS URL = situs yang sama
    Note over CMP: migrate up (60 migrasi, ledger sama)
    Note over CMP: verify:db + verify:rls
    Note over CMP: gen-schema --compare-compute (fingerprint sama)
    Note over CMP: ganti COMPUTE_SUPABASE_URL / _KEY
    Note over CMP: deploy, ~15 menit, data COMPUTE memang dibuang
